# MiniMax-M2: minimax_test_model/ and its Picchio-named twin are deliberately
# NOT ignored (~250 KB). Unlike test_model/, they are not reliably regenerable:
# the oracle is only correct on transformers < 5.0 (see the version guard in
# make_minimax_test_model.py), so the committed copy IS the reference.
minimax_test_model_deep/
minimax_test_model_deep_picchio/
